WEBVTT

01:23.370 --> 01:28.760
[A Splendid Match]

01:29.600 --> 01:31.900
[Episode 40]

01:31.980 --> 01:38.759
[Memorial]

01:47.229 --> 01:48.890
The Penal Court never fights.

01:49.840 --> 01:51.170
We either arrest people

01:52.200 --> 01:53.120
or kill them.

01:55.120 --> 01:57.380
You're interested in me too, aren't you?

01:58.509 --> 01:59.120
Get out.

02:01.220 --> 02:01.740
Get lost!

02:01.290 --> 02:03.830
[The Cold Iron Judge]

02:02.230 --> 02:02.790
Get lost!

02:04.590 --> 02:05.650
Don't tell anyone.

02:06.980 --> 02:08.979
I'm asking you to keep a secret

02:09.870 --> 02:12.130
that I only have three years left to live.

02:17.590 --> 02:22.490
[Memorial]

03:02.620 --> 03:03.630
Fifth Aunt.

03:12.560 --> 03:13.680
This is a letter from Ye Xian

03:13.610 --> 03:17.829
[To my dear sister who married into
the Gu family]

03:14.140 --> 03:15.060
to you.

03:24.760 --> 03:28.940
[Virtue Through the Ages]

03:48.240 --> 03:48.710
Sister.

03:49.880 --> 03:51.430
The Beiman army is only a few hours away

03:51.430 --> 03:52.860
from Huxiao Gorge.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.740
I just remembered

03:56.190 --> 03:57.590
that when coming to the frontier
this time,

03:57.590 --> 03:59.850
I forgot to say goodbye to you and Mother.

04:04.160 --> 04:06.090
I'm hurrying to leave you a letter,

04:06.400 --> 04:07.800
so in case I die in battle,

04:08.830 --> 04:11.230
at least this will be
some kind of farewell.

04:12.040 --> 04:13.340
You must be wondering

04:13.890 --> 04:15.820
how I could possibly die in battle.

04:15.950 --> 04:18.019
I don't quite understand it myself either.

04:18.019 --> 04:21.660
[Ye]

04:18.360 --> 04:19.600
How did I, by some twist of fate,

04:19.600 --> 04:20.860
end up leading troops?

04:22.019 --> 04:22.980
But I have to say,

04:23.630 --> 04:24.480
the name of the Ye Army

04:24.480 --> 04:25.520
is really useful.

04:26.190 --> 04:28.300
Once we unfurl
the Flying Tiger General’s Flag,

04:28.300 --> 04:29.090
hundreds of men

04:29.090 --> 04:30.490
all got their spirits up.

04:32.640 --> 04:34.390
Father's decades at the frontier

04:34.390 --> 04:35.650
were truly not in vain.

04:37.860 --> 04:38.590
Oh right,

04:39.310 --> 04:40.510
if I really do die in battle,

04:39.980 --> 04:43.940
[Great Yan]

04:41.290 --> 04:42.520
please don't cry.

04:44.170 --> 04:45.630
Before I left the capital,

04:45.750 --> 04:46.830
the physician said

04:47.870 --> 04:50.130
I could live for at most three more years.

04:50.920 --> 04:51.800
No matter what,

04:52.450 --> 04:53.850
dying on the battlefield

04:54.000 --> 04:54.800
is much better than

04:54.800 --> 04:56.530
lying in bed waiting for death.

05:00.490 --> 05:01.190
[Ye]

05:01.070 --> 05:02.600
And don't blame Gu Jinzhao.

05:03.550 --> 05:06.070
The reason I accompanied her
out of the capital

05:06.070 --> 05:06.870
was actually so I could,

05:06.870 --> 05:08.130
in my remaining years,

05:08.710 --> 05:10.570
see the frontier with my own eyes.

05:10.680 --> 05:11.240
I want to see

05:11.240 --> 05:13.010
the battlefield Father always talked about

05:13.010 --> 05:14.940
and find out what it's really like.

05:16.800 --> 05:17.950
Now I have seen it.

05:19.040 --> 05:20.440
It is right in front of me.

05:23.310 --> 05:23.770
Sister.

05:25.040 --> 05:26.700
My words are truly inadequate

05:27.240 --> 05:28.830
to describe how vast and boundless

05:28.830 --> 05:30.410
the world before me is.

05:32.510 --> 05:33.300
But I know

05:33.870 --> 05:35.690
this is where I am supposed to be.

05:39.120 --> 05:39.780
Do you think

05:40.190 --> 05:41.130
father would

05:41.240 --> 05:42.540
be extremely proud

05:42.950 --> 05:44.550
if he knew these words I said?

05:45.400 --> 05:47.130
But even if he were still alive,

05:47.620 --> 05:48.560
I wouldn't admit it

05:48.560 --> 05:49.440
to his face.

05:50.159 --> 05:50.920
Who told him to hit me

05:50.920 --> 05:52.040
so hard back then?

05:53.159 --> 05:55.290
He only cared about you, his daughter,

05:55.310 --> 05:57.040
and didn't care about me at all.

05:57.430 --> 05:58.690
But it doesn't matter.

05:59.120 --> 06:00.040
When I reach the underworld

06:00.040 --> 06:01.070
and see him,

06:01.390 --> 06:02.190
I will tell him

06:03.270 --> 06:05.600
to stop bragging about fighting
all the time.

06:05.600 --> 06:06.600
I have fought too.

06:09.000 --> 06:09.600
All right.

06:10.190 --> 06:12.190
It's time to go discuss matters
with Third Mr. Chen.

06:12.190 --> 06:13.790
This time I am the Commander,

06:13.830 --> 06:15.290
and he the Deputy General.

06:37.630 --> 06:38.360
How dare you!

06:39.159 --> 06:40.470
What I hold in my hand

06:40.500 --> 06:43.340
is the Imperial Pardon Certificate
bestowed by the late Emperor!

06:43.340 --> 06:45.000
Let's see who dares to stop me!

06:57.090 --> 06:58.500
If I really die this time,

07:00.230 --> 07:01.560
then I can only entrust Mother

07:01.560 --> 07:03.230
to you, Sister.

07:04.550 --> 07:05.880
Remember to tell Mother

07:05.880 --> 07:07.880
that I did not disgrace
the Marquis's Mansion.

07:07.880 --> 07:09.530
She didn't raise me in vain.

07:10.070 --> 07:11.860
Ask her not to grieve.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.710
I, Ye-Wen,

07:18.960 --> 07:20.760
pay my respects to Your Majesty!

07:21.660 --> 07:25.770
[Palace of Heavenly Purity]

07:31.120 --> 07:32.620
The Beiman army is marching south,

07:32.620 --> 07:34.220
and the frontier is in chaos.

07:35.070 --> 07:36.460
My son, Ye Xian,

07:37.120 --> 07:38.240
is defending Yi County to the death

07:38.240 --> 07:40.040
alongside the frontier soldiers!

07:40.040 --> 07:41.630
If Yi County falls,

07:42.020 --> 07:44.360
the Beiman cavalry will reach the capital
in 3 days.

07:44.360 --> 07:46.390
Our Great Yan will be in great danger!

07:46.390 --> 07:48.120
Today, I hold the Imperial Pardon
Certificate

07:48.120 --> 07:50.300
bestowed by the late Emperor.

07:50.220 --> 07:53.180
[Palace of Heavenly Purity]

07:50.470 --> 07:51.630
I beg Your Majesty

07:51.750 --> 07:53.800
to send reinforcements immediately

07:53.800 --> 07:55.380
to save the frontier

07:55.409 --> 07:56.950
and the people from peril!

07:57.180 --> 07:58.490
I beg Your Majesty

07:58.520 --> 07:59.740
to send reinforcements immediately

07:59.740 --> 08:01.350
to save the frontier

08:01.430 --> 08:03.110
and the people from peril!

08:11.590 --> 08:14.900
[Palace of Heavenly Purity]

08:14.970 --> 08:20.090
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

08:15.160 --> 08:16.700
This is a petition at the palace gates!

08:16.700 --> 08:18.820
Has Beiman really reached Yi County?

08:19.020 --> 08:20.220
Is this true?

08:20.440 --> 08:22.650
Then Menyuan and Shicheng
must have fallen.

08:22.650 --> 08:23.710
We must fight back.

08:23.870 --> 08:24.720
Right.

08:24.660 --> 08:26.400
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

08:25.830 --> 08:26.630
Your Majesty!

08:26.750 --> 08:28.600
If Beiman hadn't reached Yi County,

08:28.600 --> 08:29.510
why would Madam Ye

08:29.510 --> 08:31.270
carry the Imperial Pardon Certificate

08:31.270 --> 08:33.150
and kneel at the palace gates
to beg for aid?

08:33.150 --> 08:33.960
In my opinion,

08:34.240 --> 08:36.840
it's not that the frontier didn't
ask for help,

08:37.200 --> 08:38.789
but the letters for help

08:38.840 --> 08:40.270
were suppressed by those

08:40.270 --> 08:41.600
with ulterior motives.

08:48.790 --> 08:49.430
Your Majesty,

08:49.430 --> 08:51.420
such absurd words cannot be trusted.

08:51.420 --> 08:53.200
Ye-Wen trespassed into the palace,

08:53.200 --> 08:54.660
so she should be punished.

08:56.190 --> 08:56.990
Your Majesty.

08:57.280 --> 08:58.190
I think

08:58.480 --> 09:00.350
we can summon Ye-Wen and her daughter

09:00.350 --> 09:01.710
to the hall to ask what happened,

09:01.710 --> 09:03.360
and then send someone to
the Office of Transmission

09:03.360 --> 09:04.390
to check if there are

09:04.390 --> 09:05.960
any letters from the frontier.

09:05.960 --> 09:06.550
The truth

09:07.030 --> 09:08.290
will then be revealed.

09:10.610 --> 09:12.470
Minister Chang is right.

09:12.840 --> 09:14.170
Let them enter the hall.

09:34.660 --> 09:37.860
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

09:42.550 --> 09:44.020
I, Ye-Wen,

09:44.200 --> 09:46.000
pay my respects to Your Majesty!

09:48.070 --> 09:48.660
[Marquis of Changxing, Ye Guangsheng,
guarded the frontier for 20 years]

09:48.670 --> 09:49.050
[and defeated Beiman 7 times,
protecting the border]

09:49.050 --> 09:49.440
[This Certificate is specially granted]

09:49.540 --> 09:50.320
[Beiman is not yet destroyed]

09:50.030 --> 09:50.750
Lady Ye-Wen,

09:50.320 --> 09:50.710
[I, your loyal subject Ye Xian,
have fallen in the line of duty]

09:50.710 --> 09:51.110
[I report my death with reverence]

09:51.450 --> 09:53.740
what you just said outside the hall...

09:54.000 --> 09:55.190
Who taught you that?

09:55.840 --> 09:56.640
Your Majesty,

09:57.240 --> 09:58.500
no one taught me.

09:59.060 --> 10:00.730
It's because my son, Ye Xian,

10:00.870 --> 10:02.150
is fighting hard at the frontier

10:02.150 --> 10:04.210
but never received reinforcements.

10:04.400 --> 10:05.160
Helpless,

10:05.870 --> 10:08.150
he could only write to me for help.

10:09.070 --> 10:09.870
Your Majesty,

10:10.320 --> 10:12.050
you will know after reading it.

10:25.360 --> 10:26.600
I, your subject, Ye Xian,

10:26.600 --> 10:27.930
wish Your Majesty well.

10:28.720 --> 10:30.030
Beiman attacked without declaring war.

10:30.030 --> 10:30.840
Shicheng

10:31.030 --> 10:32.200
and Menyuan have fallen.

10:32.200 --> 10:33.780
The defense line is wide open,

10:33.780 --> 10:35.780
and Yi County is in imminent danger.

10:36.120 --> 10:37.360
Although Chen Yanyun and I

10:37.360 --> 10:39.160
are holding on with difficulty,

10:39.200 --> 10:40.950
we are fighting a losing battle.

10:40.950 --> 10:43.750
I hope the Imperial Court will dispatch
a large army to our aid immediately.

10:43.750 --> 10:44.350
I, Ye Xian,

10:44.360 --> 10:46.490
have no regrets about dying in battle.

10:46.770 --> 10:49.630
May our Great Yan be strong,
its people live in peace,

10:49.630 --> 10:52.160
and may it last for
ten thousand generations.

10:57.240 --> 11:00.830
[Eastern Palace]

11:04.400 --> 11:05.350
Pass this letter

11:06.000 --> 11:08.460
around among the officials
for them to read.

11:23.240 --> 11:23.840
Madam Ye,

11:25.090 --> 11:26.000
I believe

11:26.200 --> 11:27.000
what you said.

11:27.550 --> 11:28.950
Thank you, Your Majesty.

11:30.030 --> 11:30.830
Your Majesty.

11:30.870 --> 11:31.930
Prime Minister Fu!

11:32.730 --> 11:34.710
If you hadn't stubbornly insisted

11:35.120 --> 11:36.850
on cutting military spending,

11:37.150 --> 11:39.660
would the frontier be in such chaos?

11:40.720 --> 11:41.440
Now

11:42.550 --> 11:44.610
that chaos has suddenly erupted
at the frontier,

11:44.610 --> 11:49.090
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

11:44.840 --> 11:46.390
we must quickly dispatch
the Capital Garrison

11:46.390 --> 11:47.680
to ride day and night to the rescue!

11:47.680 --> 11:49.360
For all provisions, grain,
and military equipment,

11:49.360 --> 11:51.840
I am willing to use my own privy purse
to cover the costs.

11:51.840 --> 11:53.530
I wonder which of you lords

11:53.630 --> 11:55.540
is willing to step forward

11:56.000 --> 11:57.790
and lead the troops into battle?

11:57.790 --> 11:58.670
I am willing!

11:59.840 --> 12:00.570
I am willing!

12:00.720 --> 12:01.450
I am willing!

12:01.450 --> 12:02.220
I am willing!

12:02.670 --> 12:04.560
We are willing!

12:04.720 --> 12:05.720
Preposterous!

12:06.910 --> 12:07.770
Your Majesty.

12:08.550 --> 12:10.320
Deploying troops

12:10.440 --> 12:12.310
is a matter of great importance.

12:13.000 --> 12:14.170
The Ministry of War

12:14.440 --> 12:16.320
should propose suitable candidates,

12:16.320 --> 12:18.440
and a decision should be made
after careful consideration.

12:18.440 --> 12:19.150
How can

12:20.390 --> 12:22.390
people just volunteer themselves?

12:24.320 --> 12:26.080
The military situation is urgent.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.630
And you still want to discuss it
in detail!

12:27.630 --> 12:29.550
I think you are deliberately delaying!

12:29.550 --> 12:30.390
Insolent!

12:30.960 --> 12:32.780
I think you are the insolent one!

12:33.580 --> 12:34.350
[Eastern Palace]

12:35.850 --> 12:38.050
Please calm down, Your Majesty!

13:09.010 --> 13:09.910
Third Master!

13:18.750 --> 13:20.680
Behind that painting in the study,

13:20.960 --> 13:22.200
there is a box.

13:23.000 --> 13:23.750
Inside it

13:23.750 --> 13:25.810
are all the things I cherish the most.

13:27.750 --> 13:28.840
If I...

13:32.080 --> 13:33.790
Just keep it as a memento.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.970
♪ Once I wrote of spring and fall ♪

13:48.590 --> 13:51.480
♪ Yet fell through time's abyss ♪

13:53.980 --> 13:55.410
♪ Every shade turned bitter ♪

13:56.110 --> 13:59.040
♪ Every longing became sorrow ♪

14:01.140 --> 14:01.540
[Whether in palace halls
or mountain woods]

14:01.540 --> 14:01.950
[I love you not alone for
thousand acres of lands]

14:01.630 --> 14:03.170
♪ I've seen through right and wrong ♪

14:01.970 --> 14:02.300
[You have joints before breaking
through the soil]

14:02.300 --> 14:02.630
[And reach the clouds
without a selfish mind]

14:02.660 --> 14:03.070
[In Gepi you began to transform
with the dragon]

14:03.070 --> 14:03.480
[In Xiegu you joined the phoenix in song]

14:03.500 --> 14:03.830
[On a clear night with bright moon
and gentle breeze]

14:03.830 --> 14:04.170
[Only some Mr. Wang pities your solitude]

14:04.330 --> 14:07.400
♪ Old vows washed away like ash ♪

14:08.420 --> 14:14.760
♪ True devotion is knowing
the freedom within your heart ♪

14:15.480 --> 14:18.500
♪ Word by word, hand in hand ♪

14:19.340 --> 14:22.470
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

14:20.270 --> 14:21.330
Don't catch a cold.

14:23.100 --> 14:26.350
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

14:27.160 --> 14:29.710
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

14:30.990 --> 14:34.150
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

14:34.300 --> 14:36.090
[The willow branches hang green,
and the crabapple blooms pink]

14:35.070 --> 14:37.960
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

14:36.090 --> 14:37.880
[Thinking of this, thinking of that,
I hope my wish may soon come true]

14:38.800 --> 14:45.970
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

14:54.510 --> 14:56.240
The willow branches hang green,

14:56.240 --> 14:57.970
and the crabapple blooms pink.

14:58.430 --> 15:00.240
Thinking of this, thinking of that,

15:00.240 --> 15:02.040
I hope my wish may soon come true.

15:03.570 --> 15:05.210
♪ We once drank to talk of love and hate ♪

15:04.420 --> 15:06.400
Autumn of
the 35th year of Jingning.

15:06.140 --> 15:08.830
♪ But we fell into
the deep ditch of rumors ♪

15:06.570 --> 15:09.100
In the past, I painted to express
my feelings.

15:09.470 --> 15:11.120
Who would have thought that the person
in the painting

15:11.120 --> 15:12.120
would actually become my wife?

15:11.430 --> 15:12.780
♪ Meeting and parting were like
moves on a chessboard ♪

15:14.060 --> 15:16.330
♪ Every heartfelt word ended as a fault ♪

15:18.900 --> 15:20.510
I must quickly hide this painting.

15:19.100 --> 15:20.590
♪ Seen the sun rise and the moon set ♪

15:21.030 --> 15:22.690
I cannot let Jinzhao see it,

15:21.850 --> 15:24.670
♪ Only sigh that we are no longer
on the same path ♪

15:23.160 --> 15:25.360
lest she laugh at my foolish obsession.

15:25.640 --> 15:26.530
Remember this.

15:25.650 --> 15:32.340
♪ One wrong choice drove
my old friend away like a drifting bird ♪

15:27.080 --> 15:27.940
Remember this.

15:28.330 --> 15:30.080
Autumn, 2nd year of Shengde.

15:32.960 --> 15:36.210
♪ With every step, I look back ♪

15:36.800 --> 15:39.350
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

15:40.540 --> 15:43.790
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

15:44.800 --> 15:47.080
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

15:48.660 --> 15:51.510
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

15:52.470 --> 15:55.480
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

15:53.440 --> 15:53.960
My Lady!

15:56.360 --> 16:02.500
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

16:00.360 --> 16:01.670
Why are you here?

16:03.910 --> 16:04.910
I'm fine.

16:04.130 --> 16:13.590
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

16:06.510 --> 16:07.840
How many days has it been

16:10.120 --> 16:12.320
since His Majesty ordered
the troops dispatched?

16:12.320 --> 16:13.520
It has been five days.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.370
These past few days,

16:18.030 --> 16:19.430
I've been asking around.

16:20.620 --> 16:22.950
The Ministry of War's official statement

16:23.320 --> 16:25.520
is that for 50,000 troops to break camp,

16:25.790 --> 16:28.080
just the mobilization of
civilian laborers alone

16:28.080 --> 16:29.410
will take several days.

16:30.000 --> 16:32.260
And there are logistics and provisions.

16:33.270 --> 16:35.200
They said we must wait a bit longer.

16:35.390 --> 16:36.440
I also heard that

16:37.510 --> 16:41.030
although Fu Hailian has returned
to his mansion to await punishment,

16:41.030 --> 16:42.390
his people occupy key positions

16:42.390 --> 16:43.920
across the Six Ministries.

16:45.150 --> 16:46.950
With just a slight hint from him,

16:48.200 --> 16:51.200
those people will delay things
in every possible way.

16:53.510 --> 16:54.360
I see.

17:02.030 --> 17:03.360
Go tell Yao

17:04.030 --> 17:05.450
to find Uncle Ping.

17:05.920 --> 17:06.510
Tonight,

17:07.310 --> 17:08.880
take the whole Chen family

17:10.240 --> 17:11.500
and leave the capital.

17:12.400 --> 17:13.660
Don't bring anything.

17:14.160 --> 17:15.160
Bringing luggage

17:15.960 --> 17:17.560
will only arouse suspicion.

17:18.829 --> 17:20.160
Yao knows where to go.

17:21.510 --> 17:23.040
You go along to escort them.

17:23.640 --> 17:24.240
My Lady.

17:24.310 --> 17:25.440
Let me finish first.

17:28.109 --> 17:30.040
You have good martial arts skills.

17:30.830 --> 17:33.230
I want you to go and protect
the Chen family.

17:34.270 --> 17:35.310
If Fu Hailian

17:35.720 --> 17:37.580
dispatches troops successfully

17:38.400 --> 17:39.860
and rescues Third Master,

17:40.720 --> 17:41.780
you will naturally

17:42.440 --> 17:44.240
return to the capital together.

17:47.310 --> 17:48.400
If he doesn't,

17:51.310 --> 17:53.240
you don't need to come back either.

17:55.270 --> 17:56.470
I have already burned

17:56.590 --> 17:58.520
your indenture contract long ago.

17:59.160 --> 18:01.290
I also bought you several properties.

18:02.110 --> 18:02.880
The deeds

18:03.310 --> 18:05.440
have already been given to Uncle Ping.

18:06.310 --> 18:07.640
He will give them to you.

18:10.550 --> 18:11.030
My Lady.

18:12.110 --> 18:13.570
The entire Chen family...

18:14.680 --> 18:16.810
Master Yao will
take good care of them.

18:19.110 --> 18:20.510
Please don't abandon me.

18:21.350 --> 18:22.750
I want to help you.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.000
Just now...

18:37.830 --> 18:39.030
I had a dream.

18:40.590 --> 18:43.050
They say dreams are the opposite
of reality.

18:45.070 --> 18:45.920
I believe

18:47.270 --> 18:48.720
it will be a good dream.

19:00.510 --> 19:02.510
It's not that I won't let you help me,

19:03.920 --> 19:05.500
but you can't help with

19:07.510 --> 19:08.640
what I'm going to do.

19:20.350 --> 19:21.410
Since we were kids,

19:22.350 --> 19:24.810
I've treated you like my own
younger sister.

19:26.070 --> 19:27.600
I've discussed everything

19:27.790 --> 19:29.160
with you.

19:33.200 --> 19:35.000
I entrust the entire Chen family

19:35.030 --> 19:35.680
to you.

19:37.110 --> 19:38.270
Don't let me down.

19:39.830 --> 19:40.480
My Lady.

19:40.580 --> 19:41.480
Let her go.

19:46.760 --> 19:48.590
He has always been afraid of being alone.

19:48.590 --> 19:51.250
So I just stayed a little longer
to talk with him.

19:51.720 --> 19:52.260
Jinzhao.

19:54.160 --> 19:55.220
He has already done

19:55.670 --> 19:56.630
all he can.

19:58.350 --> 19:59.590
Leave the rest to us.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.070
Just go ahead and do

20:01.070 --> 20:02.180
what you want to do.

20:02.750 --> 20:03.810
As long as I'm here,

20:04.510 --> 20:06.210
no one can touch this coffin,

20:06.440 --> 20:07.750
nor the Chen family.

20:09.750 --> 20:10.350
Thank you.

21:16.140 --> 21:16.680
Stop!

22:00.510 --> 22:02.560
I thought you came here

22:03.000 --> 22:04.000
to risk your life.

22:09.310 --> 22:10.240
Here is poison.

22:11.310 --> 22:12.640
If Senior Grand Secretary

22:12.640 --> 22:14.750
is willing to dispatch troops immediately,

22:14.750 --> 22:15.510
I

22:16.050 --> 22:18.050
am willing to repay you with my life.

22:36.240 --> 22:38.550
I am already confined to my mansion
awaiting punishment.

22:38.550 --> 22:39.550
How am I qualified

22:39.550 --> 22:41.480
to talk about dispatching troops?

22:42.790 --> 22:44.360
You came to the wrong place,

22:44.470 --> 22:45.700
Madam Chen.

22:46.880 --> 22:48.860
I once spoke rudely

22:49.160 --> 22:50.620
to Senior Grand Secretary

22:50.840 --> 22:52.500
and drew my sword against you.

22:52.830 --> 22:54.630
I should apologize with my life.

23:02.030 --> 23:03.960
Now, Third Master has passed away.

23:05.030 --> 23:06.320
I have nothing left

23:06.830 --> 23:08.360
to care about in this world.

23:09.110 --> 23:10.570
But before I close my eyes,

23:11.680 --> 23:14.210
I still wish to beg
the Senior Grand Secretary

23:14.750 --> 23:16.350
to put aside past grievances

23:16.790 --> 23:18.650
and dispatch troops immediately

23:21.640 --> 23:22.770
to save the soldiers

23:22.920 --> 23:23.680
who are

23:23.680 --> 23:25.680
fighting bitterly at the frontier,

23:26.590 --> 23:27.350
and to save

23:28.230 --> 23:30.320
the people of Great Yan in peril.

23:38.160 --> 23:38.880
I...

23:39.320 --> 23:41.050
Even if I die this very instant,

23:41.870 --> 23:43.530
I will be eternally grateful.

24:02.070 --> 24:02.720
Drink it.

24:26.160 --> 24:26.970
Third Master!

24:48.490 --> 24:49.680
Jinzhao...

25:09.790 --> 25:10.880
Third Master...

25:11.640 --> 25:12.720
Third Master...

25:40.910 --> 25:41.830
Wait for me.

25:42.260 --> 25:43.720
I'll definitely find a way

25:44.110 --> 25:46.370
to get the Imperial Court to send troops.

25:51.790 --> 25:53.750
Even if no one stands behind me,

25:53.880 --> 25:55.800
I still have this vast land!

25:56.030 --> 25:56.720
Today,

25:57.790 --> 26:00.250
I will charge once more

26:00.550 --> 26:02.150
for this beautiful land!

26:02.590 --> 26:04.550
Charge!

27:45.070 --> 27:45.970
Ye Xian,

27:48.090 --> 27:49.170
did you see that?

27:51.160 --> 27:52.370
We won.

27:57.750 --> 27:58.880
This military merit

27:59.730 --> 28:01.060
belongs to you.

28:19.750 --> 28:22.700
[Fu Mansion]

28:59.160 --> 29:00.360
Is everything ready?

29:01.680 --> 29:02.880
I don't want to leave.

29:29.960 --> 29:30.830
You...

29:34.400 --> 29:35.720
Don't be too stubborn.

29:39.960 --> 29:42.490
The more I think about it,
the more I regret it.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.270
I shouldn't have trusted

29:46.270 --> 29:48.550
the nonsense of those sect leaders
in Shicheng.

29:48.550 --> 29:51.060
I ended up being tricked
by the Beiman people,

29:51.060 --> 29:53.020
and ruined your great plan.

30:03.790 --> 30:04.720
You...

30:06.830 --> 30:08.090
can't handle alcohol.

30:09.510 --> 30:10.770
Have some tea instead.

30:21.600 --> 30:23.140
At this point,

30:24.070 --> 30:25.070
I don't blame you,

30:26.480 --> 30:28.000
nor do I blame anyone else.

30:28.440 --> 30:29.110
In the final analysis,

30:29.110 --> 30:30.110
I was too hasty

30:30.110 --> 30:31.170
and too confident.

30:32.230 --> 30:34.880
I was focused on holding

30:34.910 --> 30:36.350
the Court's power in my hands

30:36.350 --> 30:37.360
and keeping the New Policies

30:37.360 --> 30:40.060
firmly in my control.

30:41.030 --> 30:43.440
I thought as long as the overall situation
was stable,

30:43.440 --> 30:46.090
even if Beiman caused trouble again,

30:46.190 --> 30:48.200
there was nothing to fear.

30:48.710 --> 30:50.400
I calculated human nature

30:50.440 --> 30:51.920
and the situation,

30:51.920 --> 30:52.980
but I didn't expect

30:52.980 --> 30:54.930
they would rebel so quickly

30:54.960 --> 30:55.890
and so fiercely.

31:02.760 --> 31:04.910
Things just don't go as planned.

31:21.190 --> 31:23.130
But I have dragged you into this.

31:29.290 --> 31:31.420
I have been married to you for 20 years,

31:34.280 --> 31:36.390
yet I couldn't give you a child.

31:37.400 --> 31:39.260
Not only have you never blamed me,

31:40.430 --> 31:42.430
you haven't even taken a concubine.

31:46.400 --> 31:47.860
For this affection alone,

31:49.110 --> 31:51.160
I am willing to live and die with you.

31:53.640 --> 31:54.970
Not taking a concubine,

31:55.070 --> 31:56.030
not wanting offspring,

31:56.030 --> 31:58.290
is because I have my own selfish motives.

31:59.750 --> 32:00.880
I know

32:02.330 --> 32:03.730
the road ahead is rough.

32:05.310 --> 32:06.760
So I don't want to...

32:07.170 --> 32:08.600
I don't care what you say.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.520
I won't abandon you

32:13.550 --> 32:14.680
and go alone.

32:32.400 --> 32:32.880
Come!

32:36.680 --> 32:37.610
Prime Minister.

32:54.440 --> 32:55.770
Take good care of Madam.

32:55.830 --> 32:56.590
-Yes.
-Yes.

33:04.590 --> 33:05.520
Prime Minister.

33:05.960 --> 33:06.550
I

33:07.500 --> 33:08.900
don't quite understand.

33:11.960 --> 33:13.240
You want to ask me

33:13.240 --> 33:15.830
why I promised Madam Chen to send troops.

33:16.310 --> 33:18.440
It's not because she begged me.

33:20.350 --> 33:21.870
It's because of Great Yan!

33:27.960 --> 33:29.960
Everything I've done over the years

33:30.110 --> 33:31.770
has been for the New Policies.

33:32.570 --> 33:34.150
If the country is gone,

33:38.640 --> 33:40.700
what's the point of the New Policies!

33:46.480 --> 33:47.150
I...

33:48.560 --> 33:49.290
understand.

33:51.000 --> 33:51.930
Prime Minister.

33:52.240 --> 33:53.240
As for Madam Chen,

33:53.510 --> 33:55.040
what are your plans for her?

34:00.090 --> 34:01.350
Keep her alive for now.

34:02.990 --> 34:04.470
As long as she is alive,

34:05.400 --> 34:07.600
someone will definitely come to see me.

34:09.850 --> 34:10.320
Yes!

34:27.659 --> 34:29.920
[Imperial]

34:31.710 --> 34:33.840
Why didn't you let me drink the poison?

34:35.510 --> 34:36.960
What would I want

34:36.960 --> 34:38.020
a woman's life for?

34:43.010 --> 34:44.920
If all goes as expected,

34:46.440 --> 34:47.489
Jiuheng

34:47.920 --> 34:50.440
will arrive in the capital tonight.

34:53.770 --> 34:55.300
You knew he was still alive?

34:55.760 --> 34:58.020
I have had many students in my life.

34:59.070 --> 35:01.210
Jiuheng is the most like me.

35:02.150 --> 35:04.280
He won't die easily.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.780
It's good that he is alive.

35:09.520 --> 35:10.940
I'll leave this dead-end

35:12.030 --> 35:13.890
situation of mine to him to break.

35:18.960 --> 35:20.230
You kept me alive

35:20.890 --> 35:23.220
because you want to use me
to threaten him.

35:28.630 --> 35:29.510
Zhang Qi.

35:33.800 --> 35:34.730
Prime Minister.

35:35.400 --> 35:37.840
Escort Madam Chen out of the mansion.

35:42.430 --> 35:44.190
I'll say it again.

35:44.890 --> 35:46.550
What would I want

35:47.070 --> 35:48.130
a woman's life for?

35:50.880 --> 35:51.470
Yes.

35:53.320 --> 35:54.140
Madam Chen,

35:56.150 --> 35:56.670
please.

36:30.020 --> 36:31.660
He should be back now.

36:32.520 --> 36:34.030
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

36:39.360 --> 36:40.290
Where is my wife?

36:43.110 --> 36:45.880
Summary of Great Yan's New Policies.

36:47.280 --> 36:49.030
This is the result of my over 10 years

36:48.210 --> 36:50.750
[Summary of Great Yan's New Policies]

36:50.030 --> 36:51.880
of implementing the New Policies.

36:51.880 --> 36:52.840
My experiences of gains and losses

36:52.840 --> 36:53.880
are all in here.

36:55.810 --> 36:57.460
What a great thing.

36:58.070 --> 36:59.710
In the 120 years of Great Yan,

36:59.710 --> 37:01.770
there have been many people in power.

37:02.000 --> 37:03.900
Whether royal relatives

37:04.110 --> 37:05.830
or important ministers,

37:05.920 --> 37:08.670
who has the talent of me, Fu Hailian?

37:09.320 --> 37:10.370
And who

37:10.440 --> 37:12.670
has the dedication of me, Fu Hailian?

37:16.110 --> 37:17.300
Jiuheng,

37:17.360 --> 37:20.320
don't you think Great Yan
has treated me unfairly?

37:20.550 --> 37:21.400
Fu Hailian!

37:21.790 --> 37:23.270
You are so arrogant!

37:24.110 --> 37:25.770
It's absolutely ridiculous!

37:26.750 --> 37:28.280
Seeking benefits for the people

37:28.280 --> 37:30.010
regardless of gains or losses.

37:30.110 --> 37:32.310
Think about your original aspiration.

37:32.360 --> 37:34.020
Where has it all gone?

37:34.710 --> 37:37.370
Seeking benefits for the people
regardless of gains or losses.

37:36.600 --> 37:39.700
[Govern with Clarity from Above]

37:37.840 --> 37:39.510
How ridiculous!

37:40.440 --> 37:41.550
If I didn't care about gains or losses,

37:41.550 --> 37:42.710
how could I, Fu Hailian,

37:42.710 --> 37:43.960
have reached

37:43.980 --> 37:45.710
the high position I hold today?

37:46.190 --> 37:47.920
And how could the new tax reform

37:48.510 --> 37:50.880
be promoted smoothly?

37:51.070 --> 37:52.000
Jiuheng,

37:52.110 --> 37:53.750
you still don't understand.

37:53.770 --> 37:55.830
That's why you are alienated from me.

37:56.710 --> 37:57.590
Forget it.

37:57.920 --> 37:58.590
Forget it.

37:59.110 --> 37:59.980
As things stand today,

37:59.980 --> 38:01.510
I, Fu Hailian, am finished.

38:01.920 --> 38:03.230
The New Policies are also finished.

38:03.230 --> 38:04.230
So today,

38:04.230 --> 38:05.190
no one

38:05.460 --> 38:06.620
leaves here.

38:06.650 --> 38:08.610
You will die here too.

38:08.960 --> 38:10.960
The New Policies won't be finished.

38:12.030 --> 38:13.190
Although dozens of the New Policies

38:13.190 --> 38:14.630
contain overly extreme measures,

38:14.630 --> 38:15.510
most of them

38:15.710 --> 38:18.040
can be called good remedies for the world!

38:18.670 --> 38:20.440
The problem is you yourself!

38:22.440 --> 38:22.900
Tell me!

38:23.510 --> 38:24.480
Where is my wife?

38:37.250 --> 38:38.150
Chen Yanyun!

38:42.190 --> 38:43.320
Put your sword down!

38:43.560 --> 38:44.510
Yuzhu!

38:44.880 --> 38:46.270
Why are you back?

38:46.500 --> 38:47.440
What do you want?

38:47.720 --> 38:48.670
Let him go!

38:49.410 --> 38:51.250
I am the true leader of Chunyuan Sect!

38:51.250 --> 38:52.950
I did everything!

38:53.260 --> 38:54.470
It has nothing to do

38:54.520 --> 38:55.990
with Fu Hailian!

38:56.110 --> 38:58.010
Why are you doing this?

38:58.800 --> 38:59.510
Master...

39:01.440 --> 39:02.710
How could I bear to just stand by

39:02.710 --> 39:04.220
and watch you die?

39:05.110 --> 39:06.280
Listen to me!

39:06.400 --> 39:07.110
I won't!

39:27.660 --> 39:28.350
Mas...

39:28.740 --> 39:29.520
ter...

39:44.320 --> 39:45.050
How are you?

39:45.470 --> 39:46.400
Are you alright?

39:46.710 --> 39:47.510
Third Master.

39:50.190 --> 39:50.990
I'm late.

40:00.390 --> 40:01.670
Master...

40:05.790 --> 40:06.800
Yuzhu!

40:13.800 --> 40:14.710
Yuzhu!

40:24.510 --> 40:25.800
Yuzhu!

40:30.760 --> 40:31.900
Fu Hailian,

40:31.420 --> 40:33.430
[Summary of Great Yan's New Policies]

40:32.250 --> 40:33.360
I, Chen Yanyun,

40:33.360 --> 40:35.690
will never make the same mistakes you did.

40:36.100 --> 40:38.560
The original aspiration
you failed to keep,

40:38.880 --> 40:41.260
I, Chen Yanyun, will hold onto it.

40:54.090 --> 40:56.170
[Summary of Great Yan's New Policies]

41:48.210 --> 41:51.420
[Fu Mansion]

42:01.990 --> 42:09.310
[Fu Mansion]

42:04.190 --> 42:07.590
By the mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees:

42:08.160 --> 42:09.780
The rebel Chunyuan Sect

42:09.880 --> 42:11.360
has spread heretical lies,

42:11.360 --> 42:12.960
violated moral principles,

42:12.960 --> 42:14.510
repeatedly incited rebellion,

42:14.510 --> 42:16.030
and poisoned the people.

42:16.190 --> 42:17.770
Their crimes are heinous

42:17.880 --> 42:19.610
and cannot be tolerated by law.

42:19.800 --> 42:23.090
Now, the chief culprits have all
been executed,

42:23.150 --> 42:25.420
and their remnants have been purged.

42:25.880 --> 42:27.930
I hope the people of our Great Yan

42:28.000 --> 42:29.610
will strictly obey the law,

42:29.710 --> 42:31.190
distinguish right from wrong,

42:31.190 --> 42:32.510
stay away from heresy,

42:32.800 --> 42:35.230
and not be confused by evil theories,

42:33.710 --> 42:37.490
[Fu Mansion]

42:35.230 --> 42:37.440
so as not to fall into disaster.

42:37.920 --> 42:39.570
Make this known to the world,

42:39.760 --> 42:41.780
so everyone is informed!

42:42.150 --> 42:43.920
Respect this decree!

42:58.040 --> 43:01.620
[Fu Mansion]

43:03.560 --> 43:07.660
[Fu Mansion]

43:09.960 --> 43:13.480
[A Splendid Match]
